abstract: >-
  Six deterministic, model-free analysis skills carrying their methodological
  requirements as executable assertions, with the heart-failure ligand-receptor
  screen reported in the accompanying article as the case study. Every figure
  regenerates from the released tables with no network access and no
  language-model call.
